          "Prioritize concrete urban quality-of-life delivery: housing affordability, public transit reliability, local public safety perception, and service accessibility are the electoral issues most salient to a $71K-income, 35-year-old urban constituency that will evaluate on whether government is functioning for them, not on partisan identity.",
