          "Invest heavily in workforce and skills-training platforms; 78.8% non-college-educated adults mean pathways beyond four-year degrees are the economic lifeline for most of the district.",
          "Frame public safety through dual equity and effectiveness lens: center community accountability and transparency with Black residents (45.31%) while affirming investment in crime reduction—false choice messaging will fail.",
          "Avoid any positioning on education privatization, safety-net reduction, or trickle-down economics; the 72% margin reflects active support for public goods and redistribution, not passive partisan loyalty."
