          "Activate renters and younger adults (24.2% renter rate, 37.4 median age) around housing affordability and job creation; these constituencies do not have inherited partisan loyalty and will respond to a challenger offering concrete economic benefits if the incumbent treats them as a settled base.",
          "Recognize that 100% unopposed is not a durable governing advantage—it reflects low Democratic mobilization and low turnout, not constituent satisfaction. Any candidate must build active, ongoing constituent relationships beyond the base or risk a credible Democratic challenge in a future cycle where opposition organization materializes."
