          { name: "Nostalgia or Anti-Progress Rhetoric", tag: "avoid", why: "A median age of 30.2 indicates a relatively young district unlikely to be motivated by backward-looking messaging or romanticized past economic conditions. High renter rates (46.3%) and modest income levels suggest voters are forward-focused on economic opportunity and stability, not resentful of change. Messaging centered on 'taking back' or 'restoring' will underperform relative to solutions-oriented platforms addressing current material needs." }
