          { name: "Crime and Public Safety (as a Central Campaign Theme)", tag: "avoid", why: "No crime data is present in the district profile, making this issue speculative. In a district with 69.7% renters and a young, educated majority, messaging should be driven by constituent priorities, not assumed crime salience. Overemphasizing public safety without local data risks misaligning with district values and appearing disconnected from actual lived concerns." }
