          "Lead with household economic security: property tax management, healthcare affordability for the 40-year-old homeowner constituency, and wage competitiveness in working-class and skilled-trades sectors are the material concerns most likely to drive defection if a credible challenger emerges and the incumbent has not established a record of tangible delivery on these issues.",
          "Build active constituent relationships in the 77% of the district that is not college-educated: this is a workforce-oriented constituency in manufacturing, agriculture, service, and skilled trades whose economic concerns are distinct from college-educated professionals and require specific advocacy, not generic Republican positioning.",
