          "Lead with homeowner economic interests: at 83% homeownership and $85,491 income, the constituency evaluates on property tax burden, education quality, housing development policy, and infrastructure maintenance — these are the material concerns that determine whether an affluent homeowner community remains reliably Republican or becomes persuadable.",
          "Engage younger professionals and families as a distinct constituency: the 41.1 median age and college attainment rate suggest a non-trivial population of younger professionals building equity in the district; housing affordability, school quality, and long-term community development planning are the issues that retain their loyalty rather than assuming age-cohort partisan inheritance.",
