          "Lead with material economic concerns, not partisan messaging — the 17.9% college attainment and $59,822 income signal a constituency that evaluates on whether government is delivering concrete economic security, not ideological positioning. Healthcare affordability, wage viability, rural infrastructure, and property tax management are the issues that drive approval in this district.",
