          "Develop granular constituent service infrastructure around renter, young family, and Hispanic household concerns: unopposed incumbents often rely on partisan base turnout rather than active constituent engagement; a challenger who offers visible constituent service on utility costs, wage theft, education funding, and healthcare access can quickly establish credibility with a working-class constituency that has not seen active outreach from the incumbent."
