          "Invest in visible constituent service and local presence: at 41.4 median age and 77.8% homeownership with modest income, this constituency evaluates representatives on whether they deliver tangible improvements to daily life — responsive constituent services, local problem-solving, and evidence of legislative attention to the district's specific needs.",
          "Engage the district's Hispanic and Black residents with specific constituent attention rather than absorbing them into a broader homeowner-majority narrative; their economic mobility and healthcare access concerns are distinct and deserve direct legislative engagement.",
